{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id135666536"}, "name":{"label":"MeMoe83"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-29T05:09:10-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"12244829955"}, "title":{"label":"Inaccurate count"}, "content":{"label":"The app is useful for setting targets but the step count is off - often by hundreds of steps - every single day. I sometimes have it open while I’m on the treadmill and it will ‘stop counting’ for 10 or 20 steps at a time and will do that more than once. Disappointing.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id683671323"}, "name":{"label":"Roger3464"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-10T16:13:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"12169144408"}, "title":{"label":"Good, not many features"}, "content":{"label":"While the app itself is decent overall, in the sense that it has accurate step-counting capabilities which sync with the Apple health app, it lacks multiple factors of functionality. A few listed, \n• Not being able to have “rest days” set automatically as days of the week. Already, it has automatic rest days after six consecutive days of meeting your steps goal, yet it seems a bit much, having to wait until you can take breaks due to digital incapability. \n• Pay-To-Use for most of the app. Why do I need a membership for a pedometer? Be so for-real.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
