{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id107596308"}, "name":{"label":"Larry 8888"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-09-12T08:32:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.4.3"}, "id":{"label":"11716551261"}, "title":{"label":"Inaccurate counters"}, "content":{"label":"It seems once you reach a continuous number of days in reaching your goal, your cumulative counters is inaccurate. When I reach about 800 days of 10K steps, I discovered 2 inaccuracy :- 1. It takes 10,100 or 20,200 , or 30,300 … to see the star burst instead of 10,000, 20,000, 30,000 etc. 2. The cumulative counter for the 7 days accumulation in the bottom is also inaccurate. You have to pad it by a large number ….. I hope you look into fixing this bug in the code ! Thank you L. Chan", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
