{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id297782442"}, "name":{"label":"Expired.pinky"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-09-10T03:49:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.4.3"}, "id":{"label":"11708817639"}, "title":{"label":"Not counting all steps"}, "content":{"label":"The last week I’ve noticed that when I go to bed my watch says 11,568 (or something similar) and wake up and it recorded on app as 5000 steps. Even the my health app says 11,000 ish. Not sure the app is accurate is anymore. Never had this problem before", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id316849875"}, "name":{"label":"Roudy Roddie"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-27T17:16:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.4.3"}, "id":{"label":"11660391522"}, "title":{"label":"Very Disappointed"}, "content":{"label":"This is the second time. For no reason all my previous records are gone. No where to be found. Nothing else missing on my 11 Pro Max. 😢😢 Now a third time lost all my data after almost 2 Years. And the last loss was on a iPhone Pro Max 15 so very very disappointed in this company. I’ve sent them emails with no response. 🥵\n\nJust adding to this again. Twice now again after 100 and some days all the data is gone and it starts over so very disappointing. This is the fourth time now I believe in three years or so.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
