{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id322635814"}, "name":{"label":"Sonner77"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-26T10:21:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.4.3"}, "id":{"label":"11537849482"}, "title":{"label":"GREAT APP"}, "content":{"label":"This is a great app for keeping track of your steps/fitness and seeing your accomplishments.  It is one of the few apps that says it’s free and actually is and usable.   They do have a paid version that is less than $3 a month that offers a bunch of other cool options but the free version also works great.  You can also connect it to your Apple Watch to make it more accurate.  I definitely would recommend this app for all iPhone users.  Thank you to the developers for creating a great app with a free version that works great.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id119923124"}, "name":{"label":"Step With Me"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-09T18:00:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.4.3"}, "id":{"label":"11474994163"}, "title":{"label":"New to the Pedometer ++"}, "content":{"label":"I recently downloaded the Pedometer ++ to my iPhone and Apple Watch because I did not care for the way they set up their steps on the Apple Watch. The bar graphs on the Pedometer are great however I wish you could get a week’s total rather than having to add up your daily steps to get the week’ s total. I upgraded from my Fitbit to the Apple Watch, but I’m not happy with their activity features. In comparison, the Fitbit steps were available on the face of the watch and they gave you a total of your steps for the week. The Pedometer meets my needs better than the activity features on the Apple Watch although neither seems to give you a total of steps for the week like the Fitbit.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
